        skos:definition        "The currently configured G-Matrix mode (definition from RAMAC CALLBACK Specification, v2.0.2, August 2021). Allowed values are 0 = reserved; 1 = help me; 2 = press it; 3 = track it; 4 = guard it; 5 = monitor it; 6 = don't lose it. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event"@en;
